	(text_box "Notes\n1. J201 is the example board's only external connection (interconnect overview).\n2. R201 holds EN_PERIPH low while no host drives it: blk.periph-switch is off by\n   default, and its absent state never depends on its own parts (RFC 0011 rule 2).\n3. Absent state: this block is always fitted; it is the board's input.\n4. PWR_FLAG marks VSYS_LV and GND as driven from outside the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
